# Append-only JSONL acceptance log; union merge is safe because each line is an
# independent record. This built-in merge needs no installed driver, so the
# committed row protects the log even in a clone where `prepare` never ran.
# Patterns are anchored to this directory, so they resolve to the demo's files
# both inside the monorepo and when the demo is copied out standalone.
/lint-ratchet.debt-log.jsonl merge=union
# Derived from the source tree, so no textual merge is ever correct. The custom
# driver (installed clone-locally by `prepare`) attempts the semantic three-way
# baseline merge, and on failure keeps "ours" as valid JSON and prints the
# recovery recipe; see ../../docs/guides/lint-ratchet-merges.md.
/lint-ratchet.baseline.json merge=lint-ratchet-baseline
